# CODEOWNERS — FACT
#
# Purpose: automatically request review from the right people when
# deployment-, OAuth-, or environment-sensitive files change.
# Implements PROJECT_PLAN.md Key Requirement #9 (OAuth Scope Review).
#
# NOTE: this is ADVISORY only. Branch protection sets
# require_code_owner_reviews=false, so these owners are auto-REQUESTED
# as reviewers but their approval is not hard-required. That is
# deliberate: hard-requiring it would block an owner's own pull requests.
#
# Reviewers (PROJECT_PLAN.md "Team"):
#   @clolry       — Chris Olry, Project Owner / Lead Developer
#   @0zelKirkland — Ozel Kirkland, Secondary Developer
#                   (note: leading character is the DIGIT ZERO, not "O")
#
# Listing both means either reviewer can satisfy the auto-request.
# @0zelKirkland must hold at least "push" (write) access for the
# auto-request to resolve — see scripts/add-collaborator.sh.

# Default owners for everything not matched below.
*                           @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Deployment and environment configuration: extra scrutiny ---
# Any change here can alter what is deployed, or where.
/.github/workflows/         @clolry @0zelKirkland
/.clasp.json                @clolry @0zelKirkland
/.claspignore               @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Apps Script manifest: OAuth scopes and advanced services ---
# Changes here can force re-authorization for every user.
/appsscript.json            @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Governance and agent behavior ---
/PROJECT_PLAN.md            @clolry @0zelKirkland
/AGENTS.md                  @clolry @0zelKirkland
/CODEOWNERS                 @clolry @0zelKirkland
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @clolry @0zelKirkland

# --- Environment bootstrap scripts (seed data, production identifiers) ---
